      "source": [
        "# Modified GBM AI\n",
        "\n",
        "Same **Modified GBM** price law (Markov sign, split-normal size, \(S_{t+1}=S_t e^{r_t}\)).\n",
        "\n",
        "What is new is **parameter estimation**:\n",
        "\n",
        "1. Start from the usual lookback counts.\n",
        "2. Simulate one-step returns in **PyTorch**.\n",
        "3. MSE vs the window’s moments.\n",
        "4. **Adam** moves \(P(U\\mid U), P(D\\mid D), \\mu_U, \\sigma_U, \\mu_D, \\sigma_D\) toward smaller error.\n",
        "\n",
        "This is **not** the continuation-value network. LSM still prices the American call.\n",
        "\n",
        "Regime notebooks (engine): `20*_modified_gbm_ai.ipynb`.  \n",
        "Study: `scripts/run_v4_1p5y_10k_return_based_mgbm_ai.py` (1.5-year lookback, monthly, 10,000 paths)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "import sys\n",
        "from pathlib import Path\n",
        "import numpy as np\n",
        "import pandas as pd\n",
        "\n",
        "ROOT = Path.cwd().resolve()\n",
        "if ROOT.name.endswith(\"notebook\"):\n",
        "    SCRIPTS = ROOT.parent / \"scripts\"\n",
        "    DATA = ROOT.parent.parent / \"research\" / \"data\"\n",
        "else:\n",
        "    SCRIPTS = ROOT / \"V4-Models_result\" / \"scripts\"\n",
        "    DATA = ROOT / \"research\" / \"data\"\n",
        "sys.path.insert(0, str(SCRIPTS))\n",
        "from modified_gbm_ai import estimate_modified_gbm\n",
        "\n",
        "prices = pd.read_csv(DATA / \"equity\" / \"prices_clean.csv\", parse_dates=[\"Date\"]).set_index(\"Date\").sort_index()\n",
        "r = np.log(prices[\"SPY\"]).diff().dropna()\n",
        "window = r.loc[:\"2008-07-31\"].iloc[-int(252 * 1.5):]\n",
        "est = estimate_modified_gbm(window)\n",
        "pd.Series({k: v for k, v in est.items() if k not in (\"signed\", \"up\", \"prev\", \"curr\", \"mag\")})"
      ]
    },
